@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Release and persistent-state boundaries
artifact "Selected application commit" as Release
folder "Application code and frontend build" as Code
folder "Laravel storage and bootstrap cache" as Runtime
database "PostgreSQL metadata" as DB
folder "Persistent bare repositories" as Repos
artifact "Paired backup + manifest + checksums" as Backup
Release --> Code : deployment artifacts
Code --> Runtime : runtime cache and logs
DB --> Backup : database dump while writes paused
Repos --> Backup : Git archive during same pause
DB <--> Repos : identity and storage consistency
note bottom of Code : Code rollback preserves persistent state\nSchema compatibility must be reviewed
note bottom of Backup : Secrets and TLS key recovery handled separately
@enduml
